### List foods
GET http://localhost:8002/api/foods/
Accept: application/json


### Retrieve an existing food
GET  http://localhost:8002/api/foods/5223f163-c930-4dcc-a9d1-aa3135b04de8/
Accept: application/json


### Retrieve a non-existing food
GET  http://localhost:8002/api/foods/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000/
Accept: application/json


### Retrieve first page of foods
GET http://localhost:8002/api/foods/
Accept: application/json


### Retrieve second page of foods
GET http://localhost:8002/api/foods/?page=2
Accept: application/json


### Retrieve five foods per page
GET http://localhost:8002/api/foods/?page_size=1
Accept: application/json


### Filter foods by name
GET http://localhost:8002/api/foods/?search=manzana
Accept: application/json


### Filter foods by category
GET http://localhost:8002/api/foods/?category_id=fdf27f12-53b9-48d0-835d-6bd6122bbdd7
Accept: application/json


### Filter foods by name and category
GET http://localhost:8002/api/foods/?search=pera&category_id=fdf27f12-53b9-48d0-835d-6bd6122bbdd7
Accept: application/json


### Order foods by name ascending
GET http://localhost:8002/api/foods/?ordering=name
Accept: application/json


### Order foods by name descending
GET http://localhost:8002/api/foods/?ordering=-name
Accept: application/json


### Order foods by creation date ascending
GET http://localhost:8002/api/foods/?ordering=created_at
Accept: application/json


### Order foods by creation date descending
GET http://localhost:8002/api/foods/?ordering=-created_at
Accept: application/json


### Test invalid ordering
GET http://localhost:8002/api/foods/?ordering=invalid_field
Accept: application/json


### Verify food list does not allow PUT
PUT http://localhost:8002/api/foods/
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### Verify food detail does not allow POST
POST http://localhost:8002/api/foods/5223f163-c930-4dcc-a9d1-aa3135b04de8/
Content-Type: application/json

{}
